{"title":"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be a positive integer and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be a finite set of odd prime numbers. Prove that there is at most one way (up to rotation and reflection) to place the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> around a circle such that the product of any two neighbours is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11c4a454b9babe7c29b740d221034cabfbcc91a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + x + k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nYD-qIOdi_c\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nYD-qIOdi_c</a> [Video contains solutions to all day 1 problems]\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_kF9uXCZ6l4\">https://youtu.be/_kF9uXCZ6l4</a> [Video Solution by little fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO\" title=\"2022 IMO\">2022 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\